  m_text: The Survival Game is a 3D adventure game where players must survive in
    a challenging and hostile environment by exploring the world, collecting resources,
    crafting essential tools, and managing health and supplies. Players face various
    obstacles such as enemies, environmental hazards, and limited resources, requiring
    strategic planning and quick decision-making. The game combines exploration,
    combat, and resource management to create an immersive experience while improving
    problem-solving, critical thinking, and survival skills.
